Under every reading of the 4 open sentences, the conclusion follows: *For every instance of Claude, for every situation, if all of the following hold:
  (a) both that situation is classified as "creating_a_cyberweapon" and that situation is classified as "could_cause_significant_damage_if_deployed";
  (b) both that instance of Claude has the recorded relation "knowingly_engages_3_wide" to that situation and that instance of Claude has the recorded relation "knowingly_engages_3_narrow" to that situation, then it is not the case that that instance of Claude may do the creation in that situation.*
